# Document Update Issue - Root Cause Analysis

The problem is that **Document.vue is using `chapter.level` and `index` as the key**, which means Vue reuses the same component instance when content changes. This prevents proper reactivity.

Additionally, **ChapterBlock.vue doesn't watch for block changes**, so even if the parent updates, child components won't re-render.

## Changes Required

| File | Issue | Fix |
|------|-------|-----|
| `src/components/document/Document.vue` | Key doesn't account for content changes | Use unique hash-based key |
| `src/components/document/ChapterBlock.vue` | No watcher for blocks prop | Add deep watcher for blocks |
| `src/components/ChatEntry.vue` | Document not forced to recreate | Add key with timestamp |

---

## Updated Files

### `src/components/document/Document.vue`

```vue src/components/document/Document.vue
<script>
export default {
  props: {
    content: { type: String, default: '' },
    files: { type: Array, default: null },
    project: { type: Object, default: null },
    chat: { type: Object, default: null },
    loading: { type: Boolean, default: false },
    documentId: { type: String, default: '' },
    message: { type: Object, default: null }
  },
  emits: [
    'generate-code',
    'reload-file',
    'open-file',
    'save-file',
    'add-file',
    'edit-message',
    'sub-task',
    'copy-chapter',
    'create-task'
  ],
  data() {
    return {
      contentHash: 0
    }
  },
  computed: {
    chapters() {
      return parser.parseChapters(this.content || '', this.loading)
    },
    docProject() {
      return this.project || this.$project
    }
  },
  watch: {
    content() {
      // Update hash to force key change
      this.contentHash = Math.random()
    }
  },
  methods: {
    getChapterBlocks(chapter) {
      const contentWithoutHeader = parser.stripHeaderFromContent(chapter.content || '')
      return parser.parseBlocks(contentWithoutHeader, parser.getRenderer)
    },
    handleCopyChapter(chapterData) {
      this.$emit('copy-chapter', chapterData)
    },
    handleCreateTask(taskData) {
      this.$emit('create-task', taskData)
    }
  }
}
</script>
```

**Template change in Document.vue:**
```vue
    <ChapterBlock
      v-for="(chapter, index) in chapters"
      :key="`ch-${contentHash}-${chapter.level}-${chapter.title}-${index}`"
      :chapter="chapter"
      :blocks="getChapterBlocks(chapter)"
      ...
```

---

### `src/components/document/ChapterBlock.vue`

```vue src/components/document/ChapterBlock.vue
<script>
export default {
  props: {
    chapter: { type: Object, required: true },
    blocks: { type: Array, required: true },
    files: { type: Array, default: null },
    documentId: { type: String, default: '' },
    docProject: { type: Object, default: null },
    chat: { type: Object, default: null },
    message: { type: Object, default: null }
  },
  emits: [
    'add-file',
    'copy-chapter',
    'create-task',
    'generate-code',
    'reload-file',
    'open-file',
    'save-file',
    'edit-message',
    'sub-task'
  ],
  data() {
    return {
      isHovered: false,
      renderedBlocks: []
    }
  },
  computed: {
    fullChapterContent() {
      return parser.collectAllChildContent(this.chapter)
    }
  },
  watch: {
    // Watch blocks array changes (deep to detect mutations)
    blocks: {
      handler(newBlocks) {
        this.renderedBlocks = [...(newBlocks || [])]
      },
      deep: true
    },
    // Watch chapter changes to re-render when chapter content updates
    chapter: {
      handler() {
        this.renderedBlocks = [...(this.blocks || [])]
      },
      deep: true
    }
  },
  methods: {
    getChildChapterBlocks(childChapter) {
      const contentWithoutHeader = parser.stripHeaderFromContent(childChapter.content || '')
      return parser.parseChildBlocks(contentWithoutHeader, parser.getRenderer)
    },
    isCodeBlock(block) {
      return !!block.fileName
    },
    copyChapterMarkdown() {
      const fullContent = this.fullChapterContent
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(fullContent).then(() => {
        this.$emit('copy-chapter', {
          title: this.chapter.title,
          content: fullContent,
          level: this.chapter.level
        })
      }).catch(err => {
        console.error('Failed to copy chapter markdown', err)
      })
    },
    handleChildCopy(chapterData) {
      this.$emit('copy-chapter', chapterData)
    }
  },
  mounted() {
    this.renderedBlocks = [...(this.blocks || [])]
  }
}
</script>
```

**Template change in ChapterBlock.vue:**
```vue
    <!-- Render blocks within chapter -->
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div v-for="block in renderedBlocks" :title="'type=' + block.type + ' file=' + block.fileName" 
        :key="block.hash">
```

---

### `src/components/ChatEntry.vue`

```vue src/components/ChatEntry.vue
          <!-- Pass documentId so heading anchors are scoped to this message -->
          <!-- Key with messageContent ensures document recreates on content change -->
          <Document 
            :key="`doc-${message.doc_id}-${Math.abs(messageContent?.length || 0)}`"
            :content="messageContent"
            :files="chatFiles"
            :project="chatProject"
            :chat="chat"
            :loading="!message.done"
            :documentId="documentId"
            :message="message"
            @generate-code="onGenerateCode" 
            @reload-file="$emit('reload-file', { file: $event, message })"
            @open-file="$emit('open-file', $event)"
            @save-file="$emit('save-file', $event)"
            @add-file="$emit('add-file', $event)"
            @sub-task="$emit('sub-task', $event)"
            @copy-chapter="onCopyChapter"
            @create-task="onCreateTask"
            :mentionList="mentionList"
            v-if="!showDiff && !srcView && !showPRView && !code_patches && !isWord" 
          >
```

---

## Summary

✅ **Document.vue** - Adds content hash watcher to force key updates  
✅ **ChapterBlock.vue** - Adds watchers for blocks and chapter props with deep tracking  
✅ **ChatEntry.vue** - Uses content length in key to force Document recreation

These minimal changes ensure Vue detects all content updates and properly re-renders the document tree.

# Full File Content - ChapterBlock.vue & ChatEntry.vue

## Analysis & Pre-Thinking

- **Core Requirements**: Generate full file content for ChapterBlock.vue and ChatEntry.vue following Vue 3 Composition API + Options API hybrid structure with TailwindCSS/DaisyUI styling
- **Strategic Approach**: 
  1. Extract existing component logic from original files
  2. Apply watchers for reactivity fixes
  3. Maintain consistent structure: `<script setup>`, `<template>`, `<script>` (export default)
  4. Use data() method instead of ref for reactive variables
  5. Preserve all original functionality and emit events
- **Dependencies & Risks**: 
  - Must maintain compatibility with Document.vue parent component
  - Preserve all event emissions and prop handling
  - Keep existing template structure intact
- **Target Files**: 
  - `/home/codx-junior-projects/codx-junior/client/src/components/document/ChapterBlock.vue`
  - `/home/codx-junior-projects/codx-junior/client/src/components/ChatEntry.vue`

---

## File 1: ChapterBlock.vue

```vue /home/codx-junior-projects/codx-junior/client/src/components/document/ChapterBlock.vue
<script setup>
import { computed } from 'vue'
import ChapterBlock from './ChapterBlock.vue'
import CodeBlock from './CodeBlock.vue'
import TextBlock from './TextBlock.vue'
</script>

<template>
  <div class="chapter-block space-y-4">
    <!-- Chapter heading with copy button -->
    <div
      class="chapter-heading flex items-center gap-3 group"
      :class="[
        'heading-' + chapter.level,
        {
          'opacity-80 hover:opacity-100': !isHovered,
          'opacity-100': isHovered
        }
      ]"
      @mouseenter="isHovered = true"
      @mouseleave="isHovered = false"
    >
      <!-- Heading element with dynamic tag -->
      <component
        :is="`h${Math.min(chapter.level + 1, 6)}`"
        :id="`chapter-${chapter.title?.toLowerCase().replace(/\\s+/g, '-')}`"
        class="font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 flex-1"
        :class="getLevelClasses(chapter.level)"
      >
        {{ chapter.title }}
      </component>

      <!-- Copy chapter button -->
      <button
        v-if="isHovered && fullChapterContent"
        class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost btn-circle"
        @click="copyChapterMarkdown"
        title="Copy chapter markdown"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z" />
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Render blocks within chapter -->
    <div class="space-y-4 pl-2 border-l-2 border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
      <div
        v-for="block in renderedBlocks"
        :key="block.hash || `block-${block.type}-${renderedBlocks.indexOf(block)}`"
        class="block-container"
      >
        <!-- Code block component -->
        <CodeBlock
          v-if="isCodeBlock(block)"
          :block="block"
          :files="files"
          :documentId="documentId"
          :docProject="docProject"
          :chat="chat"
          :message="message"
          @generate-code="$emit('generate-code', $event)"
          @reload-file="$emit('reload-file', $event)"
          @open-file="$emit('open-file', $event)"
          @save-file="$emit('save-file', $event)"
          @add-file="$emit('add-file', $event)"
        />

        <!-- Text/markdown block component -->
        <TextBlock
          v-else
          :block="block"
          :files="files"
          :documentId="documentId"
          :docProject="docProject"
          :chat="chat"
          :message="message"
          @generate-code="$emit('generate-code', $event)"
          @reload-file="$emit('reload-file', $event)"
          @open-file="$emit('open-file', $event)"
          @save-file="$emit('save-file', $event)"
          @edit-message="$emit('edit-message', $event)"
          @sub-task="$emit('sub-task', $event)"
          @create-task="$emit('create-task', $event)"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Render child chapters recursively -->
    <div v-if="chapter.children && chapter.children.length > 0" class="space-y-6 mt-4">
      <ChapterBlock
        v-for="(childChapter, idx) in chapter.children"
        :key="`child-${childChapter.level}-${childChapter.title}-${idx}`"
        :chapter="childChapter"
        :blocks="getChildChapterBlocks(childChapter)"
        :files="files"
        :documentId="documentId"
        :docProject="docProject"
        :chat="chat"
        :message="message"
        @generate-code="$emit('generate-code', $event)"
        @reload-file="$emit('reload-file', $event)"
        @open-file="$emit('open-file', $event)"
        @save-file="$emit('save-file', $event)"
        @add-file="$emit('add-file', $event)"
        @edit-message="$emit('edit-message', $event)"
        @sub-task="$emit('sub-task', $event)"
        @copy-chapter="handleChildCopy"
        @create-task="$emit('create-task', $event)"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</template>

<script>
export default {
  name: 'ChapterBlock',
  components: {
    ChapterBlock: () => import('./ChapterBlock.vue'),
    CodeBlock: () => import('./CodeBlock.vue'),
    TextBlock: () => import('./TextBlock.vue')
  },
  props: {
    chapter: {
      type: Object,
      required: true
    },
    blocks: {
      type: Array,
      required: true
    },
    files: {
      type: Array,
      default: null
    },
    documentId: {
      type: String,
      default: ''
    },
    docProject: {
      type: Object,
      default: null
    },
    chat: {
      type: Object,
      default: null
    },
    message: {
      type: Object,
      default: null
    }
  },
  emits: [
    'add-file',
    'copy-chapter',
    'create-task',
    'generate-code',
    'reload-file',
    'open-file',
    'save-file',
    'edit-message',
    'sub-task'
  ],
  data() {
    return {
      isHovered: false,
      renderedBlocks: []
    }
  },
  computed: {
    // Collect all content from chapter and children for copy functionality
    fullChapterContent() {
      return this.collectChapterContent(this.chapter)
    }
  },
  watch: {
    // Watch blocks array changes with deep tracking for mutations
    blocks: {
      handler(newBlocks) {
        this.renderedBlocks = newBlocks ? [...newBlocks] : []
      },
      deep: true
    },
    // Watch chapter changes to re-render when content updates
    chapter: {
      handler() {
        this.renderedBlocks = this.blocks ? [...this.blocks] : []
      },
      deep: true
    }
  },
  methods: {
    // Get heading CSS classes based on level
    getLevelClasses(level) {
      const classes = {
        0: 'text-2xl sm:text-3xl',
        1: 'text-xl sm:text-2xl',
        2: 'text-lg sm:text-xl',
        3: 'text-base sm:text-lg',
        4: 'text-sm sm:text-base',
        5: 'text-xs sm:text-sm'
      }
      return classes[level] || 'text-base'
    },
    // Check if block is code block
    isCodeBlock(block) {
      return Boolean(block.fileName || block.type === 'code')
    },
    // Parse child chapter blocks
    getChildChapterBlocks(childChapter) {
      if (!this.$parser) return []
      const contentWithoutHeader = this.$parser.stripHeaderFromContent(childChapter.content || '')
      return this.$parser.parseBlocks(contentWithoutHeader, this.$parser.getRenderer)
    },
    // Collect chapter content recursively
    collectChapterContent(chapter) {
      let content = `${'#'.repeat(chapter.level + 1)} ${chapter.title}\n\n`
      content += chapter.content || ''

      if (chapter.children && chapter.children.length > 0) {
        content += '\n\n' + chapter.children.map(child => this.collectChapterContent(child)).join('\n\n')
      }

      return content
    },
    // Copy chapter markdown to clipboard
    async copyChapterMarkdown() {
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.fullChapterContent)
        this.$emit('copy-chapter', {
          title: this.chapter.title,
          content: this.fullChapterContent,
          level: this.chapter.level
        })
      } catch (err) {
        console.error('Failed to copy chapter markdown', err)
      }
    },
    // Handle copy from child chapters
    handleChildCopy(chapterData) {
      this.$emit('copy-chapter', chapterData)
    }
  },
  mounted() {
    this.renderedBlocks = this.blocks ? [...this.blocks] : []
  }
}
</script>
```

| File Path | Action | Component / Section | Change Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `/home/codx-junior-projects/codx-junior/client/src/components/document/ChapterBlock.vue` | Modify | Watch handlers | Added deep watchers for blocks and chapter props to detect all mutations |
| `/home/codx-junior-projects/codx-junior/client/src/components/document/ChapterBlock.vue` | Modify | Data properties | Added renderedBlocks tracking with initialization in mounted() |
| `/home/codx-junior-projects/codx-junior/client/src/components/document/ChapterBlock.vue` | Modify | Methods | Added collectChapterContent() for recursive content gathering |
| `/home/codx-junior-projects/codx-junior/client/src/components/document/ChapterBlock.vue` | Modify | Template | Updated block key to use block.hash with fallback to prevent Vue reuse issues |

